offset_right = 1300.0
offset_bottom = 780.0
text = "A bounded skirmish session: SkirmishScenario spawns real Village resources into the real GameState/Reach/Naklon (no parallel state), plus a real, skirmish-paced LouhiDirector opponent (package N's actual script, retuned faster). Every ~6s this demo simulates 'a player tending a village' via the same Reach.convert_via_help() any real conversion uses, standing in for real player input, which this package does not read. Watch Louhi react, relent, or escalate against a real bounded timer; a rematch starts automatically a few seconds after the session ends."
